{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course it was all a dream. No coherent story. No motivation. Nothing made sense. No one around.<br>Just ran, or tried to. Heavy legs. Barely able to move. But to jump felt like flying.<br>So collect hearts. Collect brains. Use power-ups. Success is simple, so long as success is enough <br><br>---<br><br>configurable platform game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >side-scroll, third-person, first-person</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >individual levels, zone, or full campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >high pressure time limits and health, or turn them off for casual terrain traversal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >overwhelming OSD can be reduced or disabled</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mouse sensitivity and fov adjustment, and head bob/screen shake toggles</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Unsuccessful Once","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1124170/380231480b53e9244a7e9478a954f937ec34bfa5.jpg"},{"name":"Unsuccessful Ten Times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1124170/380231480b53e9244a7e9478a954f937ec34bfa5.jpg"},{"name":"Unsuccessful Fifty Times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1124170/380231480b53e9244a7e9478a954f937ec34bfa5.jpg"},{"name":"Successful Once","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1124170/76705619fda82a010062f035c68b6f1dd9523a43.jpg"},{"name":"Successful Ten Times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1124170/175b87b8ed23ca30f090031947ec0d035bae0b7b.jpg"},{"name":"Successful One-Hundred Times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1124170/e25d1f9bc4f982af269b738b73185b3b01ab4d88.jpg"},{"name":"Successful Two-Hundred and Fifty Times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/stea